            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<strong>Village Monsters</strong> is an open-ended <strong>village life game</strong> set in the world of a long-forgotten video game. You play as the sole human living in a community of (mostly) friendly monsters<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/679830/extras/e73a6246866cb778477bcd47f4b02e59.avif?t=1747090261\" width=750 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features!</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Befriend dozens of whimsical monsters</strong>, each with their own quirky personalities and problems to solve.<br></li><li><strong>Pursue many exciting hobbies</strong> that let you hunt for treasure, collect and train creatures, cultivate gardens, and catch legendary fish.<br></li><li><strong>Help restore the village</strong> and save your new community from destruction.<br></li><li><strong>Unravel unique personal stories</strong> as you build friendships and unlock special Heart-to-Heart events with each villager.<br></li><li><strong>Engage in a variety of daily activities.</strong> Earn money with a part-time job, join in village events and holidays, go on adventures - or just hang out with your monster pals and watching some TV.<br></li><li><strong>Buy a fixer-upper</strong> and transform it into your very own comfy-cozy homestead.<br></li><li><strong>Explore vast areas</strong> outside the village ranging from vibrant forests, arctic deserts, fog-choked valleys, and the ruins of a best-forgotten empire.<br></li><li><strong>Immerse yourself in a simulated world</strong> that boasts shifting weather patterns, sweeping seasonal changes, and unscripted interactions.<br></li><li><strong>Harness the glitches of a run-down game</strong> and use them to unlock abilities and even mend the world.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Village Monsters</strong> is an open-ended <strong>village life game</strong> set in the world of a long-forgotten video game. You play as the sole human living in a community of (mostly) friendly monsters<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/679830/extras/e73a6246866cb778477bcd47f4b02e59.avif?t=1747090261\" width=750 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features!</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Befriend dozens of whimsical monsters</strong>, each with their own quirky personalities and problems to solve.<br></li><li><strong>Pursue many exciting hobbies</strong> that let you hunt for treasure, collect and train creatures, cultivate gardens, and catch legendary fish.<br></li><li><strong>Help restore the village</strong> and save your new community from destruction.<br></li><li><strong>Unravel unique personal stories</strong> as you build friendships and unlock special Heart-to-Heart events with each villager.<br></li><li><strong>Engage in a variety of daily activities.</strong> Earn money with a part-time job, join in village events and holidays, go on adventures - or just hang out with your monster pals and watching some TV.<br></li><li><strong>Buy a fixer-upper</strong> and transform it into your very own comfy-cozy homestead.<br></li><li><strong>Explore vast areas</strong> outside the village ranging from vibrant forests, arctic deserts, fog-choked valleys, and the ruins of a best-forgotten empire.<br></li><li><strong>Immerse yourself in a simulated world</strong> that boasts shifting weather patterns, sweeping seasonal changes, and unscripted interactions.<br></li><li><strong>Harness the glitches of a run-down game</strong> and use them to unlock abilities and even mend the world.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Village Monsters is a cozy town life game set in a forgotten world. You play as the sole human living in a community of (mostly) friendly monsters.",
